"<strong>Accounting</strong>: Easily generate tax reports and other financial "
"documents thanks to our localization packages."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການບັນຊີ</strong>: ສ້າງລາຍງານພາສີ ແລະ ເອກະສານທາງການເງິນອື່ນໆ ໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ "
"ດ້ວຍແພັກເກດການປັບຕາມທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#. module: gallery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gallery.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Add Images &amp; Categorization</strong>:"
msgstr "<strong>ເພີ່ມຮູບພາບ &amp; ການຈັດໝວດໝູ່</strong>:"

#. module: gallery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gallery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>CRM</strong>: Manages customer relationships, tracks leads and "
"inquiries, and boosts sales potential."
msgstr ""
"<strong>CRM</strong>: ຄຸ້ມຄອງສາຍພົວພັນກັບລູກຄ້າ, ຕິດຕາມລູກຄ້າກຸ່ມເປົ້າໝາຍ ແລະ ການສອບຖາມ, "
"ພ້ອມທັງເພີ່ມໂອກາດໃນການຂາຍ."

#. module: gallery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gallery.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Contacts</strong>: Organizes and stores client information for "
"personalized follow-ups."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່</strong>: ຈັດລະບຽບ ແລະ ເກັບຮັກສາຂໍ້ມູນລູກຄ້າ ເພື່ອການຕິດຕາມແບບສະເພາະບຸກຄົນ."

#. module: gallery
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:gallery.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Create a Product</strong>:"
msgstr "<strong>ສ້າງສິນຄ້າ</strong>:"

